# USER.md

*Canonical user profile shared by every hub this user builds. Imported by each hub's Layer 1 CLAUDE.md by reference, not by copy.*

*Per hub-os framework Section 5. Human-curated, rarely edited. Claude proposes promotions at session end; user approves. If this file is changing weekly, something is wrong — probably hub-specific content is sneaking in.*

**Location:** copy this template to `~/thehub/USER.md` (the provisional default) or wherever you want the user-scoped anchor to live. See `FRAMEWORK.md` Section 1 preamble for the three open angles on location (thehub namespace vs user namespace; single file vs split; relationship to Claude Code auto-memory).

