## 5. Cross-hub preferences

*Rules that apply in every hub you will ever build. Not domain-specific, not client-specific. The universal slice of your preferences.*

*Examples of what belongs here: design preferences, communication preferences, meta-rules you've taught Claude through feedback, cross-tool conventions you always use.*

*Examples of what does NOT belong here: hub-specific rules (e.g., "don't mutate Shopify without approval" — lives in the relevant hub's never list), domain-specific practices (e.g., "always pull GSC alongside Ahrefs" — lives in that domain's ops role CLAUDE.md).*

